WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:03,420
He knew I was rich, so he came to rob me.

2
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:09,820
What do you want to do if you break down the door in the middle of the night?

3
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:10,820
Open the door quickly

4
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:13,680
We're here to reason with you.

5
00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:16,580
Dissolution document written in black and white

6
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:18,540
The captain and the village elders all testified

7
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:20,140
I have nothing to do with you anymore

8
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:21,820
Blood ties can be broken at any time

9
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,100
The blood left on you is the blood of the old Qin family

10
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:26,700
Put me in a woodshed and starve to death. Call it blood relationship.

11
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:29,380
Sucked me dry for twenty years and you still want to keep sucking me dry

12
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:32,420
Cut the nonsense and pour out the wild boar meat.

13
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:35,420
Get lost now. I'll pretend it didn't happen.

14
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:37,660
If you knock on the door again, don't blame me for being rude.

15
00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:39,480
Smash it hard

16
00:00:57,810 --> 00:00:59,210
I say it one last time
